iOS integration docs (it lists the ad networks' identifiers) and paste it here.
Without it, iOS ad attribution may not work.
-->

<!-- Export compliance: the app uses only standard HTTPS/WSS encryption -->
<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
<false/>
